## Pre-Commit Checklist

- [ ] Changes limited to owned module (+ agreed shared docs)
- [ ] API contract updated if endpoints changed
- [ ] No `.env` or secrets in diff
- [ ] Tests pass / build succeeds
- [ ] No Gemini key or DB credentials in frontend
